  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　調味料。パルデア地方では　無糖よりも甘いほうが　人気らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 강한 조미료. 팔데아지방에서는 무가당보다 당분이 있는 쪽이 인기 있다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味強勁的調味料。在帕底亞地區，有甜味似乎比無甜味更受到歡迎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très sucré. À Paldea, la version sucrée semble être plus populaire que la version nature.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein sehr süßes Würzmittel. In Paldea steht diese Variante offenbar höher im Kurs als die zuckerfreie Alternative.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente muy dulce. La versión con azúcar añadido es la más popular en Paldea.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto dolce. A Paldea questa versione è più amata di quella senza zucchero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very sweet condiment. People in Paldea seem to favor the sweet varieties over the unsweetened.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　調味料。パルデア地方では　無糖よりも甘いほうが　人気らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味强烈的调味料。在帕底亚地区比起无糖，似乎甜甜的更受人欢迎。",
